# SnakrX Functions Configuration

Copy this file to `functions/.env` for local emulation or manual local testing.
Production Functions should receive the same values from your deployed Functions environment.

EMAIL_USER=your-email@example.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-app-password
EMAIL_FROM=SnakrX <your-email@example.com>
SUPPORT_EMAIL_TO=support@example.com
OTP_SALT=replace-with-a-long-random-string
